        <h2 id="scope-title">Scope</h2>
        <p>
          This website is a personal portfolio operated by Sebastián Hudák. It is intended to present
          engineering work, education, experience, and contact information. The website is built as a
          static site and is designed to collect as little personal data as reasonably possible.
        </p>
        <p>
          This notice follows the transparency information normally required under the GDPR for EU and
          EEA visitors, including the identity of the controller, purposes, legal bases, recipients,
          retention criteria, data subject rights, and complaint options.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" id="controller" aria-labelledby="controller-title">
        <h2 id="controller-title">1. Controller</h2>
        <dl class="privacy-definition">
          <div>
