      <section class="privacy-block" id="data" aria-labelledby="data-title">
        <h2 id="data-title">2. Personal Data Processed</h2>
        <p>This website may involve the following limited categories of personal data:</p>
        <ul class="privacy-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Technical access data:</strong> IP address, request date and time, browser or user
            agent, requested URL, referrer, approximate location derived from network data, and similar
            server log information.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Contact data:</strong> name, email address, message content, and any other details
            you choose to include when contacting me.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>External-link data:</strong> if you click links to LinkedIn, GitHub, Instagram,
            YouTube, or other external websites, those services may receive information according to
            their own privacy notices.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Third-party font requests:</strong> this site currently loads Google Fonts. Your
            browser may send technical request data such as IP address, user agent, and requested font
            files to Google when Inter and Space Grotesk are loaded.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Please do not send special categories of personal data, confidential information, or proprietary
          information through the contact form unless it is necessary and you are authorised to do so.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" id="purposes" aria-labelledby="purposes-title">
        <h2 id="purposes-title">3. Purposes Of Processing</h2>
        <ul class="privacy-list privacy-list--divided">
          <li>
            <span>Operating and securing the website</span>
            <p>Technical access data may be processed to deliver pages, prevent abuse, debug errors, and keep the website available.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>Responding to messages</span>
            <p>Contact data is used to read, reply to, and follow up on messages you send.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>Improving the portfolio</span>
            <p>Aggregated or technical information may be used to understand whether pages work correctly and whether content is useful.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>Protecting rights and content</span>
            <p>Information may be used where necessary to handle misuse, legal claims, or requests about project material, images, logos, or credits.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" id="legal-basis" aria-labelledby="legal-basis-title">
        <h2 id="legal-basis-title">4. Legal Basis</h2>
        <p>
          Where the GDPR applies, the following legal bases may be used:
        </p>
        <div class="privacy-table" role="table" aria-label="Legal bases">
          <div role="row">
            <span role="columnheader">Processing</span>
            <span role="columnheader">Legal basis</span>
          </div>
          <div role="row">
            <span role="cell">Operating, securing, and maintaining the website</span>
            <span role="cell">Legitimate interests: providing a functional, secure portfolio website.</span>
          </div>
          <div role="row">
            <span role="cell">Responding to messages you send</span>
            <span role="cell">Legitimate interests and, where relevant, steps requested before entering a collaboration or contract.</span>
          </div>
          <div role="row">
            <span role="cell">Complying with legal requests or protecting legal claims</span>
            <span role="cell">Legal obligation or legitimate interests, depending on the situation.</span>
          </div>
          <div role="row">
            <span role="cell">Loading web fonts and maintaining a consistent interface</span>
            <span role="cell">Legitimate interests: presenting the website in its intended visual form.</span>
          </div>
          <div role="row">
            <span role="cell">Optional consent-based features, if added later</span>
            <span role="cell">Consent, which can be withdrawn at any time.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          Providing contact data is voluntary. If you do not provide a valid way to contact you, I may not
          be able to reply. Technical access data is generated automatically when your browser requests
          this website and is necessary to deliver the pages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" id="retention" aria-labelledby="retention-title">
        <h2 id="retention-title">5. Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Personal data is kept only for as long as needed for the purpose for which it was collected.
          The criteria used are:
        </p>
        <ul class="privacy-list">
          <li>Contact messages are kept for as long as needed to respond and manage the relationship or request.</li>
          <li>Messages related to projects, collaboration, or legal matters may be kept longer where necessary for records or legal claims.</li>
          <li>Technical server logs are retained according to the hosting provider's security and operations policies.</li>
          <li>Aggregated statistics that no longer identify a visitor may be kept for longer.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" id="sharing" aria-labelledby="sharing-title">
        <h2 id="sharing-title">6. Recipients, Processors, And Transfers</h2>
        <p>
          This site is hosted as a static website using GitHub Pages. GitHub and related infrastructure
          providers may process technical access data to deliver the website and protect the service.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you contact me, your message may be processed by the email services used by you and by me.
          Personal data is not sold, rented, or shared for advertising purposes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google may receive technical request data when Inter and Space Grotesk are loaded through
          Google Fonts. Social platforms or other external services may receive data only when you open
          their links or when your browser requests their resources.
        </p>
        <p>
          Some providers may be located outside the EU/EEA. Where such transfers occur, they are handled
          by those providers under their own terms, safeguards, and privacy notices. External links are
          not controlled by this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" id="rights" aria-labelledby="rights-title">
        <h2 id="rights-title">7. Your GDPR Rights</h2>
        <p>
          If the GDPR applies to you, you may have the following rights, subject to the conditions and
          limits in the GDPR:
        </p>
        <ul class="privacy-rights">
          <li>Right to be informed about processing.</li>
          <li>Right of access to your personal data.</li>
          <li>Right to rectification of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
          <li>Right to erasure where the data is no longer needed or processing is unlawful.</li>
          <li>Right to restriction of processing in specific cases.</li>
          <li>Right to data portability where processing is based on consent or contract and is automated.</li>
          <li>Right to object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
          <li>Right to withdraw consent at any time where processing is based on consent.</li>
          <li>Right not to be subject to qualifying automated decisions, including profiling.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You can exercise these rights through the <a href="/contact.html">contact page</a>. I may need
          enough information to verify the request. Requests will be handled without undue delay and
          normally within one month, unless the GDPR allows more time. You also have the right to lodge a
          complaint with your local EU/EEA data protection authority.
        </p>
        <p>
          This website does not use automated decision-making or profiling.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" id="cookies" aria-labelledby="cookies-title">
        <h2 id="cookies-title">8. Cookies And Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not use advertising cookies, behavioural tracking pixels, or cross-site
          marketing trackers. In the current site code, no analytics script is loaded and no analytics
          cookies are set by this website.
        </p>
        <p>
          If cookie-free, privacy-friendly analytics is added in the future, this notice should be updated
          before or at the time of that change, including the provider, purpose, data categories, legal
          basis, and retention.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-block" aria-labelledby="security-title">
        <h2 id="security-title">9. Security</h2>
        <p>
          Reasonable technical and organisational measures are used to keep this website minimal and
          reduce unnecessary data collection. No internet service can be guaranteed completely secure, so
          avoid sending sensitive or confidential information through ordinary email or web forms.
        </p>
      </section>

